  "html": "<p>Ratsputin's Gulag is the tenth dungeon proceeding from <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"Shadow's Embrace\">Shadow's Embrace</a>.\nIt is accessable from the outpost, <a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Holding_Cell\" title=\"Ratsputin's Holding Cell\">Ratsputin's Holding Cell</a>.\nThis is currently the last and highest level Dungeon.\n</p>\n<table class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" summary=\"Contents\"><tr><td><div id=\"toctitle\"><h2>Contents</h2></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Level_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Level 1</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#The_Whisker.27s_Library_-_Propaganda_Section\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Whisker's Library - Propaganda Section</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#NPC.27s\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">NPC's</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#Rattle_Tooth.27s_Revenge\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Rattle Tooth's Revenge</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Level_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Level 2</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Pi.C3.B1ata_Invitational\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Piñata Invitational</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Tomb_of_the_AFK_Bolshevist\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Tomb of the AFK Bolshevist</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Level_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Level 3</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Ratsputin.27s_Underground_Network_-_Level_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ratsputin's Underground Network - Level 1</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#The_Gulag.27s_Solitary_Confinement_-_Wing_A\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Gulag's Solitary Confinement - Wing A</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Level_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Level 4</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#The_Whisker.27s_Library_-_Edict_Section\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Whisker's Library - Edict Section</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#Sissirat.27s_Revenge\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Sissirat's Revenge</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Pi.C3.B1ata_Invitational_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Piñata Invitational</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Tomb_of_the_AFK_Bolshevist_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Tomb of the AFK Bolshevist</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Level_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Level 5</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Ratsputin.27s_Underground_Network_-_Level_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ratsputin's Underground Network - Level 2</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#The_Gulag.27s_Solitary_Confinement_-_Wing_B\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Gulag's Solitary Confinement - Wing B</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Level_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Level 6</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Pi.C3.B1ata_Invitational_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Piñata Invitational</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Tomb_of_the_AFK_Bolshevist_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Tomb of the AFK Bolshevist</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Level_7\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Level 7</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#The_Whisker.27s_Library_-_Dogma_Section\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">The Whisker's Library - Dogma Section</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#Vergrim.27s_Revenge\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Vergrim's Revenge</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Ratsputin.27s_Yoga_Room\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ratsputin's Yoga Room</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Ratsputin.27s_Maximum_Security_Kremlin\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ratsputin's Maximum Security Kremlin</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Ratsputin.27s_Treasure_Room\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ratsputin's Treasure Room</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td></tr></table>\n<a name=\"Level_1\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 1</span></h1>\n<p>Level one of Ratsputin's Gulag is accessible through the portal located in <a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Holding_Cell\" title=\"Ratsputin's Holding Cell\">Ratsputin's Holding Cell</a>. The dungeon itself is far from what you could have expected by the weather in the outpost, this level looks just like a regular dungeon, so no open fields. This skin also appears in <a href=\"/wiki/PvP\" title=\"PvP\">PvP</a>.\n</p><p>Contains: <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Puker\" title=\"Ice Puker\">Ice Pukers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Hellion\" title=\"Hellion\">Hellions</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Fade_General\" title=\"Divine Fade General\">Divine Fade Generals</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Fade_Lichlord\" title=\"Divine Fade Lichlord\">Divine Fade Lichlords</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Fade_Soldier\" title=\"Divine Fade Soldier\">Divine Fade Soldiers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frostbitten_Conscript\" title=\"Frostbitten Conscript\">Frostbitten Conscripts</a>, *<a href=\"/wiki/Lava_Rachnid\" title=\"Lava Rachnid\">Lava Rachnids</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lava_Hatchling\" title=\"Lava Hatchling\">Lava Hatchlings</a>, <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Banned_Farmer\" title=\"Banned Farmer\">Banned Farmer</a>, <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Punkin\" title=\"Punkin\">Punkinsas</a> well as portals to <a href=\"/wiki/The_Whisker's_Library_-_Propaganda_Section\" title=\"The Whisker's Library - Propaganda Section\">The Whisker's Library - Propaganda Section</a> and Ratsputin's Gulag Level 2.\n</p>\n<a name=\"The_Whisker.27s_Library_-_Propaganda_Section\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">The Whisker's Library - Propaganda Section</span></h2>\n<p>One thing is sure: It fits the name. There are all kind of whisker creatures as well as the library dungeon skin. Same skin as Frump's, only then a bit emptier.\n</p><p>Contains: <a href=\"/wiki/Ebon_Fade_Soldier\" title=\"Ebon Fade Soldier\">Ebon Fade Soldiers</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ebon_Devastator!\" title=\"Ebon Devastator!\">Ebon Devastators!</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Runt\" title=\"Divine Runt\">Divine Runts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Arctic_Blademaster\" title=\"Arctic Blademaster\">Arctic Blademasters</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Whisker\" title=\"Ice Whisker\">Ice Whiskers</a>, <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Divine_Juggernaught\" title=\"Divine Juggernaught\">Divine Juggernaughts</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frostbitten_Blaster\" title=\"Frostbitten Blaster\">Frostbitten Blasters</a>, <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Banned_Farmer\" title=\"Banned Farmer\">Banned Farmer</a> and a one-way portal to: <a href=\"/wiki/Rattle_Tooth's_Revenge\" title=\"Rattle Tooth's Revenge\">Rattle Tooth's Revenge</a>\n</p>\n<a name=\"NPC.27s\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\">NPC's</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Chet_the_Decembrist\" title=\"Chet the Decembrist\">Chet the Decembrist</a>\n</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Rattle_Tooth.27s_Revenge\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Rattle Tooth's Revenge</span></h3>\n<p>This dungeon uses the dungeon skin that also appears in <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>. It is empty when you arrive, and once you walk further you will see Rattle Tooth in a ghostly form. Strange enough he appears to be a Fodder here. Why, you ask? If you attack him a pretty big amount of Frostbitten Blasters and Arctic Blademasters will spawn. Once they are dead you can leave again and are teleported back to Ratsputin's Gulag Level 1.\nThe sound that is used in this dungeon is the same as the one in <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Rattle_Tooth's_Lair\" title=\"Rattle Tooth's Lair\">Rattle Tooth's Lair</a>, but this one is sort of a remix as you hear strange sounds through it.\n</p><p>Contains: <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Rattle_Tooth's_Ghost\" title=\"Rattle Tooth's Ghost\">Rattle Tooth's Ghost</a>, <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Rattle_Tooth's_Vengeful_Blaster\" title=\"Rattle Tooth's Vengeful Blaster\">Rattle Tooth's Vengeful Blasters</a>, <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Rattle_Tooth's_Vengeful_Soul\" title=\"Rattle Tooth's Vengeful Soul\">Rattle Tooth's Vengeful Soul</a>, <a class=\"missing\" href=\"/wiki/Rattle_Tooth's_Vengeful_Blastemaster\" title=\"Rattle Tooth's Vengeful Blastemaster\">Rattle Tooth's Vengeful Blastemasters</a>, 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Chests\" title=\"Treasure Chests\">Treasure Chests</a>, and a one-way portal to Ratsputin's Gulag Level 1.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_2\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 2</span></h1>\n<p>Contains … <a href=\"/wiki/Piñata_Invitational\" title=\"Piñata Invitational\">Piñata Invitational</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Tomb_of_the_AFK_Bolshevist\" title=\"Tomb of the AFK Bolshevist\">Tomb of the AFK Bolshevist</a> are located off Level 2.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Pi.C3.B1ata_Invitational\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Piñata Invitational</span></h2>\n<p>Contains ...\n</p>\n<a name=\"Tomb_of_the_AFK_Bolshevist\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Tomb of the AFK Bolshevist</span></h2>\n<p>Contains ... There is also a <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Bankers\" title=\"Category:Bankers\">Banker</a> NPC here.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_3\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 3</span></h1>\n<p>Contains ... <a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Underground_Network_-_Level_1\" title=\"Ratsputin's Underground Network - Level 1\">Ratsputin's Underground Network - Level 1</a> and<a href=\"/wiki/The_Gulag's_Solitary_Confinement_-_Wing_A\" title=\"The Gulag's Solitary Confinement - Wing A\"> The Gulag's Solitary Confinement - Wing A</a> are located off Level 3.\n</p>\n<a name=\"Ratsputin.27s_Underground_Network_-_Level_1\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Ratsputin's Underground Network - Level 1</span></h2>\n<p>Contains …\n</p>\n<a name=\"The_Gulag.27s_Solitary_Confinement_-_Wing_A\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\">The Gulag's Solitary Confinement - Wing A</span></h3>\n<p>Contains ...\n</p>\n<a name=\"Level_4\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Level 4</span></h1>\n<p>Contains ... <a href=\"/wiki/The_Whisker's_Library_-_Edict_Section\" title=\"The Whisker's Library - Edict Section\">The Whisker's Library - Edict Section</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sissirat's_Revenge\" title=\"Sissirat's Revenge\">Sissirat's Revenge</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Piñata_Invitational\" title=\"Piñata Invitational\">Piñata Invitational</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Tomb_of_the_AFK_Bolshevist\" title=\"Tomb of the AFK Bolshevist\">Tomb of the AFK Bolshevist</a> are located off Level 4.\n</p>\n<a name=\"The_Whisker.27s_Library_-_Edict_Section\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">The Whisker's Library - Edict Section</span></h2>\n<p>Contains …\n</p>\n<a name=\"Sissirat.27s_Revenge\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Sissirat's Revenge</span></h3>\n<p>Contains ...\n</p>\n<a name=\"Pi.C3.B