tle=\"The Whisker's Library - Dogma Section\">The Whisker's Library - Dogma Section</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Revenge\" title=\"Vergrim's Revenge\">Vergrim's Revenge</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Yoga_Room\" title=\"Ratsputin's Yoga Room\">Ratsputin's Yoga Room</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Maximum_Security_Kremlin\" title=\"Ratsputin's Maximum Security Kremlin\">Ratsputin's Maximum Security Kremlin</a> are located off Level 7 \n</p>\n<a name=\"The_Whisker.27s_Library_-_Dogma_Section\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">The Whisker's Library - Dogma Section</span></h2>\n<p>Contains …\n</p>\n<a name=\"Vergrim.27s_Revenge\"></a><h3> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Vergrim's Revenge</span></h3>\n<p>Contains ...\n</p>\n<a name=\"Ratsputin.27s_Yoga_Room\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Ratsputin's Yoga Room</span></h2>\n<p>Contains …\n</p>\n<a name=\"Ratsputin.27s_Maximum_Security_Kremlin\"></a><h1> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Ratsputin's Maximum Security Kremlin</span></h1>\n<a name=\"Ratsputin.27s_Treasure_Room\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Ratsputin's Treasure Room</span></h2>\n<p>Contains ... 6 <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Chests\" title=\"Treasure Chests\">Treasure Chests</a>.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
